# Integration / e2e test configuration (example).
#
# By default the integration and e2e suites do NOT need this file: they spin an
# ephemeral Postgres (PostGIS + TimescaleDB + pgvector) via testcontainers-go and
# apply the real migrations automatically. A running Docker daemon is the only
# requirement.
#
# Override the test container image (e.g. to pin a version or use a local mirror):
# TEST_POSTGRES_IMAGE=timescale/timescaledb-ha:pg17

# The POI service constructs a Gemini client at startup (no network call is made
# until a request). The e2e harness sets dummy values itself; set these only if
# you run the POI integration tests in an environment that pre-checks them.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=test-key
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Optional shared cache for integration tests against a real Redis instance:
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# CACHE_KEY_PREFIX=loci:test:
